<section class="section" id="join">
    <p class="label">Who We Work With</p>
    <h2 class="section-h">Built for Every Innovator</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">Whether you come from the lab, the clinic, or the boardroom — there is a place for you in the Tafelberg Ventures platform.</p>
    <div class="audience-grid">

        <div class="audience-card" id="join-clinicians">
            <span class="audience-tag tag-clinical">Clinicians &amp; Researchers</span>
            <h3>You have the knowledge. We handle the rest.</h3>
            <p class="audience-hook">"My job is medicine, not business" — we hear that. And we agree.</p>
            <p class="audience-desc">You don't need to become an entrepreneur. You need a partner who can translate your clinical insight into a scalable solution. Tafelberg Ventures provides the structure, the legal setup, the business mentors, and the capital connections — so you can stay focused on what you do best.</p>
            <ul class="audience-list">
                <li>Dedicated business development support</li>
                <li>IP protection and spin-off guidance</li>
                <li>Access to FN Olomouc clinical validation infrastructure</li>
                <li>Connection to investors and industry partners</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="audience-card" id="join-startups">
            <span class="audience-tag tag-startup">Startups &amp; Innovators</span>
            <h3>Validate in a real hospital. Scale with confidence.</h3>
            <p class="audience-hook">"We have the product — we need clinical proof."</p>
            <p class="audience-desc">Clinical validation is the hardest and most valuable step in MedTech. Tafelberg Ventures opens the doors of FN Olomouc for structured pilots, real patient data access (within legal frameworks), and clinical co-development with department heads and researchers.</p>
            <ul class="audience-list">
                <li>Structured clinical pilot programmes</li>
                <li>Access to anonymised patient data and cohorts</li>
                <li>Co-development with clinical specialists</li>
                <li>Regulatory and reimbursement pathway guidance</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="audience-card" id="join-investors">
            <span class="audience-tag tag-investor">Investors &amp; Capital Partners</span>
            <h3>Curated deal flow from the heart of clinical practice.</h3>
            <p class="audience-hook">"Where do I find validated MedTech opportunities in Central Europe?"</p>
            <p class="audience-desc">Every project in our pipeline has been evaluated by clinicians, tested against real patient needs, and stress-tested for commercial viability. We connect venture funds, family offices, and angel investors with innovations that have real hospital backing behind them.</p>
            <ul class="audience-list">
                <li>Pre-screened, hospital-validated deal flow</li>
                <li>Co-investment structures with public grant matching</li>
                <li>Early-stage access to spin-off projects</li>
                <li>LP and strategic partnership opportunities</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="audience-card" id="join-industry">
            <span class="audience-tag tag-industry">Industry &amp; Corporate Partners</span>
            <h3>The most direct route to clinical co-development in the region.</h3>
            <p class="audience-hook">"We need a real hospital partner for our innovation pipeline."</p>
            <p class="audience-desc">Pharma, MedTech, Digital Health, and Life Sciences companies gain a structured gateway into FN Olomouc — one of the Czech Republic's leading university hospitals. Pilot your technology, run studies, or co-develop solutions with our clinical teams under clear governance.</p>
            <ul class="audience-list">
                <li>Structured industry collaboration frameworks</li>
                <li>Access to clinical departments and data infrastructure</li>
                <li>Joint R&amp;D and grant applications</li>
                <li>Regional market entry and expansion support</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>
